      "cooked": "<p>\"The first time Spite would be dealt damage each turn, reduce that damage by H-2.\"</p><p>What happens if the first instance of damage that turn is Irreducible?</p><p>a) It count as the PL602's first use, and all subsequent damage is not reduced by PL602?</p><p>b) PL602 has no effect and thus it isn't used for \"the first time\", and it reduces the subsequent reducible attack?</p>",
